# Project: {{project_name}} — Agent Governance Constitution

> **Agent Governance Constitution.** This file defines the non-negotiable security and safety invariants, database boundaries, git guardrails, and operational workflows for the {{project_name}} workspace. For day-to-day command recipes, environment prerequisites, and domain workflows, see `GEMINI.md`. Both files are auto-loaded by Antigravity IDE and Gemini CLI.

