## 2. Agent Skills & Rituals

The `.agents/` directory contains structured rules and skills governing autonomous operations:

| Skill | Path | Purpose |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Session Start** | `.agents/skills/session-start/SKILL.md` | Loads overview context, syncs wiki-db, surfaces previous goals, and activates today's focus. |
| **Session Wrapup** | `.agents/skills/session-wrapup/SKILL.md` | Completes daily goals, offers optional retrospective in wiki/retro/, syncs PostgreSQL wiki-db, runs drift check, and commits changes locally. |
| **Cadence Manager** | `.agents/skills/cadence-manager/SKILL.md` | Operates `scripts/cadence.py` across domain phases in Firestore `{{firestore_collection}}`. |
| **Wiki-DB Sync** | `.agents/skills/wiki-db-sync/SKILL.md` | Two-step sync: exports markdown to `wiki_bundle.json` and upserts into PostgreSQL under `repo = '{{postgres_repo_key}}'`. |
| **Drift Enforcer** | `.agents/skills/drift-enforcer/SKILL.md` | Checks dependency hashes across `docs/drift_registries/` and stamps baselines during wrapup. |

